'''Jade Flask''' is a [[utility flask]] base type. __NOTOC__

==Modifiers==
{{Main|List of modifiers for utility flasks}}

{{Item unique versions}}

{{Item acquisition}}
It can also be purchased from town NPC by random. E.g. [[Bestel]] (Act 6), [[Yeena]] (Act 7), [[Clarissa]] (Act 8), [[Petarus and Vanja]] (Act 9)
{{Item skin list}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 4.00 seconds instead.

